TERMS OF ARCHIVE DISTRIBUTION

This repository serves as a non-commercial archive of the original,
unmodified Dependency Walker executable, provided for the following
purposes:

1. To assist developers working with Nuitka-compiled executables
   in analyzing DLL dependencies.

2. To provide access to this tool when the official website is
   unavailable or non-functional.

3. To support the open-source community in troubleshooting
   missing or corrupted DLL issues.

